          "Operations"
        ],
        "description": "List all of the installations on a device. Many installations reference an\napp (`clock`, `weather`, `stocks`, etc.) that a user has installed on the Tidbyt.\nIf the appID field is blank or omitted, the installation represents an image file\nthat was pushed via the API.\n\nThere may be multiple installations of the same app. For example, a device\nmight have two installations of the `stocks` app that show different\nstock symbols.\n\nCurrently the configuration of each installation is not available via this\nAPI. For example, if a device has two installations of `stocks`, this API\ncannot currently tell you which stock symbol each installation is configured\nto show.",
        "operationId": "PublicAPI_ListInstallations",
        "summary": "List installations"
      }
    },
